  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Equity in health GEGA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">J&#xE4;mlikhet i h&#xE4;lsa GEGA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Health Equity Alliance or the Global Equity Gauge Alliance (GEGA) is a group of 12 national &quot;gauges&quot; for health equity and access to health services. Its main objectives are 1. support of 12 national gauges and continuously work for inclusion of more gauges and 2. be a strong voice in the international discourse for equity in health and access to health services.</narrative>
  </description>
